@startuml
title Serviqo - Module 2: Worker Profile & Service Category Management

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor Worker
actor Customer
actor Administrator as Admin
actor "Image Storage Service" as ImageStorage

rectangle "Serviqo Worker Profile & Service Category Management" {
  usecase "Manage worker profile" as ManageProfile
  usecase "Edit personal and\nprofessional details" as EditProfile
  usecase "Upload or update\nprofile photo" as ProfilePhoto

  usecase "Manage service\ncategory and skills" as ManageSkills
  usecase "Select primary\nservice category" as SelectCategory
  usecase "Add or remove\ntechnical skills" as EditSkills
  usecase "Set hourly rate" as SetRate

  usecase "Manage availability" as ManageAvailability
  usecase "Set working days\nand hours" as SetSchedule
  usecase "Set response-time\npreference" as SetResponseTime

  usecase "Manage work portfolio" as ManagePortfolio
  usecase "Add portfolio\nphotos and captions" as AddPortfolio
  usecase "Remove portfolio item" as RemovePortfolio

  usecase "Submit or update\nidentity documents" as SubmitIdentity
  usecase "Review worker\nverification documents" as ReviewIdentity
  usecase "Approve worker\nverification" as ApproveIdentity
  usecase "Reject verification\nwith a review note" as RejectIdentity

  usecase "Search workers" as SearchWorkers
  usecase "Filter workers by\ncategory, city or name" as FilterWorkers
  usecase "View public worker\nprofile and reviews" as ViewWorker
}

Worker -- ManageProfile
Worker -- ManageSkills
Worker -- ManageAvailability
Worker -- ManagePortfolio
Worker -- SubmitIdentity
Admin -- ReviewIdentity

Customer -- SearchWorkers
Customer -- ViewWorker

ManageProfile ..> EditProfile : <<include>>
ManageProfile ..> ProfilePhoto : <<include>>
ProfilePhoto -- ImageStorage

ManageSkills ..> SelectCategory : <<include>>
ManageSkills ..> EditSkills : <<include>>
ManageSkills ..> SetRate : <<include>>

ManageAvailability ..> SetSchedule : <<include>>
ManageAvailability ..> SetResponseTime : <<include>>

ManagePortfolio ..> AddPortfolio : <<include>>
ManagePortfolio ..> RemovePortfolio : <<include>>
AddPortfolio -- ImageStorage
SubmitIdentity -- ImageStorage
ApproveIdentity ..> ReviewIdentity : <<extend>>
RejectIdentity ..> ReviewIdentity : <<extend>>

SearchWorkers ..> FilterWorkers : <<include>>
ViewWorker ..> SearchWorkers : <<extend>>

note right of ManageSkills
Workers select one primary category
from the categories provided by Serviqo.
They manage their own skills and hourly rate;
they do not create platform categories.
end note

note bottom of SearchWorkers
Worker search results include active,
platform-verified workers. Public profiles
show profile details and customer reviews,
but exclude private contact and identity data.
end note

note bottom of SubmitIdentity
Workers submit identity documents. An
administrator reviews the documents and
approves or rejects the verification request.
end note

note right of Admin
Admin verification decisions are included
because they directly complete the worker
document-submission flow. Admin does not
edit worker profile or service-category data.
end note

@enduml
